        {
            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Figure 1: Quantizing OPT models to 4 and BLOOM models to 3 bit precision, comparing GPTQ with the FP16 baseline and round-to-nearest (RTN) (Yao et al., 2022; Dettmers et al., 2022).</div>\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                209,
                567,
